 benefit.</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-24T14:03:31Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Ensuring Veterans’ Final Resting Place Act of 2025","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-02-04T05:06:25Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-02-04T05:06:25Z"}
